/*!

*\page delay Delay
*
*Generic wait function.
* It provides a simple NOP-type delay or wait capability. <BR>
*<span style='color:blue'><em><H4> Syntax: </H4></em></span>
*<B> delay VALUE,TYPE</B><BR>
* - <b>VALUE:</b> Any Integer number representing the delay
* - <b>TYPE:</b> Three types are available as follows:
*	- Sec:&nbsp;&nbsp;  The delay will be in seconds.
*	- mSec: The delay will be in milliseconds.
*	- uSec: The delay will be in microseconds.<br>
*
*<span style='color:blue'><em><B>
*Example:
*</B> </em> </span><br>
* put PA_1, 1;			&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  <span style='color:green'> rem put HIGH at the PA_1.</span><br>
* delay 500,usec ;		&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  <span style='color:green'> rem 500 microseconds delay between the first and second instruction.</span><br>
* put PA_1,0;			&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  <span style='color:green'> rem put LOW at the PA_1.</span><br>
*
*
*/
